  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ROAP/VIE01/MOBILIZING YOUTH PARTICIPATION  AND CULTURAL DYNAMICS  FOR HA NOI CREATIVE CITY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposed project is also a joint initiative between UNESCO, UN-Habitat and UNIDO in contribution to the One UN Strategic Plan for the 2017-2021 period in Viet Nam (Outcome 3.1 By 2021, Viet Nam&#x2019;s growth policies and institutions support a new economic model, which is inclusive, sustainable and more productivity-led. To lead and co-convene the key project components including (1) a network of youth-led creative hubs fostering creativity; (2) a pilot platform of cultural heritage and creativity festival enabling youth-led culture and artwork in partnership with universities; (3) co-convening the strategic vision exercise and (4) supporting selected pilot Hero projects improving public and creative spaces.</narrative>
  </description>
